<title>HONG KONG: Lam Soon mulls capital restructuring.</title>
<headline>Lam Soon mulls capital restructuring.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lam Soon (Hong Kong) Ltd and its Lam Soon Food Industries Ltd subsidiary said on Friday they were considering proposals for a possible capital restructuring of the companies.</p>
<p>&quot;The consideration of these proposals is at an early stage,&quot; the companies said in a joint statement.</p>
<p>&quot;A further announcement will be made when a decision whether to proceed with the capital restructurings is made or as necessary,&quot; they added.</p>
<p>On Thursday, shares of Lam Soon (Hong Kong) rose HK$0.20 to HK$1.55, while Lam Soon Food gained HK$0.17 to HK$0.89.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
